stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING : student submits request
  PENDING --> APPROVED : staff approves request
  PENDING --> REJECTED : staff rejects request
  PENDING --> CANCELLED : student cancels request
  APPROVED --> QUEUED : payment confirmed
  APPROVED --> CANCELLED : student cancels request
  QUEUED --> COMPLETED : staff marks order completed
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  note right of QUEUED
    Key - filled dot = initial state,
    dot in ring = final state,
    arrow label = triggering event
  end note
